---
import BachLayout from "../../layouts/BachLayout.astro";
---

<BachLayout title="Installation & Updates" currentPath="/system/installation-updates">
  <section class="install-page" id="installation-updates" data-installation-updates>
    <header class="install-hero">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">SYSTEM · INSTALLATIONEN UND UPDATES</p>
        <h1>Installation & Updates</h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">Hier siehst du Bestände und Installationsstände, die das System belegen kann. Online-Updates und Installationen werden freigeschaltet, sobald der Installationsdienst verbunden ist.</p>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary refresh-button" id="install-refresh" type="button">↻ Inventare neu einlesen</button>
    </header>

    <section class="overview-grid" aria-label="Backend und Prüfstand">
      <article class="summary-card summary-backend">
        <span class="summary-label">Systemanbindung</span>
        <strong id="backend-name">Prüfe Verbindung …</strong>
        <span id="backend-detail" class="summary-detail">Systemanbindung wird geprüft.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-card">
        <span class="summary-label">Installationsziel</span>
        <strong id="target-host">Noch nicht belegt</strong>
        <span class="summary-detail">Das Ziel wird noch nicht geliefert.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-card">
        <span class="summary-label">Bestände</span>
        <strong id="catalog-count">Wird geprüft</strong>
        <span class="summary-detail">Nur bestätigte Bestandsbereiche.</span>
      </article>
      <article class="summary-card">
        <span class="summary-label">Stand</span>
        <strong id="observed-at">Noch nicht gelesen</strong>
        <span class="summary-detail">Zeitpunkt der letzten Bestandsprüfung.</span>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="lifecycle-panel" aria-labelledby="lifecycle-title">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">INSTALLATIONSDIENST</p>
          <h2 id="lifecycle-title">Planung und Änderungen</h2>
        </div>
        <span class="status-pill status-locked" id="lifecycle-badge">Installationsdienst noch nicht verbunden</span>
      </div>
      <p class="lifecycle-reason" id="lifecycle-reason" role="status" aria-live="polite">Installieren, Aktualisieren und Entfernen sind hier noch nicht verfügbar. Die belegten Bestände bleiben davon getrennt sichtbar.</p>
      <div class="lifecycle-grid">
        <article class="lifecycle-step"><span class="step-number">01</span><div><strong>Vorschau</strong><p>Abhängigkeiten und mögliche Konflikte</p></div><span class="step-state">Noch nicht verbunden</span></article>
        <article class="lifecycle-step"><span class="step-number">02</span><div><strong>Bestätigen</strong><p>Änderungen vorab prüfen und freigeben</p></div><span class="step-state">Noch nicht verbunden</span></article>
        <article class="lifecycle-step"><span class="step-number">03</span><div><strong>Installieren / aktualisieren</strong><p>Nach Prüfung und Bestätigung</p></div><span class="step-state">Noch nicht verbunden</span></article>
        <article class="lifecycle-step"><span class="step-number">04</span><div><strong>Entfernen</strong><p>Abhängigkeiten und Datenerhalt prüfen</p></div><span class="step-state">Noch nicht verbunden</span></article>
        <article class="lifecycle-step"><span class="step-number">05</span><div><strong>Ergebnis prüfen</strong><p>Änderung belegen und bei Bedarf zurückrollen</p></div><span class="step-state">Noch nicht verbunden</span></article>
      </div>
      <div class="action-row" aria-describedby="lifecycle-reason">
        <button type="button" class="btn" disabled title="Der Installationsdienst ist noch nicht verbunden">Planvorschau</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary" disabled title="Der Installationsdienst ist noch nicht verbunden">Installieren oder aktualisieren</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger" disabled title="Der Installationsdienst ist noch nicht verbunden">Entfernen</button>
      </div>
      <p class="lifecycle-footnote">Ein Katalogeintrag allein belegt weder eine Installation noch einen laufenden Dienst.</p>
      <details class="technical-diagnostics">
        <summary>Technische Diagnose</summary>
        <p id="lifecycle-diagnostic">Die Systemanbindung wird geprüft.</p>
        <p id="inventory-diagnostic">Die Bestände werden geprüft.</p>
      </details>
    </section>

    <section class="catalog-section" aria-labelledby="catalog-title">
      <div class="section-heading catalog-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">BESTAND UND VERFÜGBARKEIT</p>
          <h2 id="catalog-title">Komponentenübersicht</h2>
          <p class="section-copy">Angezeigte Fassungen stammen aus den verbundenen Beständen. Online-Versionen und Änderungen erscheinen erst, wenn sie zuverlässig bestätigt werden. Für Bundles ist noch kein Bestand verbunden.</p>
        </div>
        <label class="catalog-search">Einträge filtern<input id="catalog-search" type="search" placeholder="Name oder Kategorie" autocomplete="off" /></label>
      </div>
      <p id="catalog-status" class="catalog-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Bestände werden geladen …</p>
      <div id="catalog-grid" class="catalog-grid" aria-live="polite"></div>
      <p class="empty-state" id="catalog-empty" hidden>Für diesen Filter gibt es keine Einträge in den geladenen Beständen.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="skills-links" aria-labelledby="skills-links-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">NUTZUNG UND ZUORDNUNG</p>
        <h2 id="skills-links-title">Skills & Software</h2>
        <p>Client-Aktivierung und Agentenzuordnung bleiben in ihren bestehenden Ansichten. Diese Links installieren oder verändern nichts.</p>
      </div>
      <nav class="management-links" aria-label="Installierte Fähigkeiten ansehen">
        <a href="/skills">Skills ansehen <span>↗</span></a>
        <a href="/skills/plugins">Plugins ansehen <span>↗</span></a>
        <a href="/skills/mcp">MCP ansehen <span>↗</span></a>
        <a href="/skills/software">Software ansehen <span>↗</span></a>
        <a href="/skills/ocean">Ocean ansehen <span>↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </section>
  </section>
</BachLayout>

<script>
  import "../../scripts/installation-updates.mjs";
</script>

<style>
  .install-page {display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.25rem;padding:1rem 0 2rem;color:var(--text)}
  .install-hero {display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg, 18px);background:radial-gradient(circle at 88% 0%,color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 18%,transparent),transparent 34%),var(--bg-panel);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)}
  .install-hero h1 {font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.6rem);margin:.2rem 0 .5rem;letter-spacing:-.035em}
  .eyebrow {margin:0;color:var(--accent-text);font-size:.7rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.13em;text-transform:uppercase}
  .hero-copy,.section-copy,.skills-links p {max-width:75ch;margin:.2rem 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.9rem;line-height:1.6}
  .refresh-button {white-space:nowrap}
  .overview-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.75rem}
  .summary-card {display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;padding:1rem 1.05rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:var(--bg-card)}
  .summary-backend {border-top:2px solid var(--accent)}
  .summary-label {color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em}
  .summary-card strong {overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:1rem}
  .summary-detail {color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.45}
  .lifecycle-panel,.catalog-section,.skills-links {padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-lg, 18px);background:var(--bg-panel)}
  .section-heading {display:flex;align-items:flex-end;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .section-heading h2,.skills-links h2 {margin:.2rem 0 .35rem;font-size:1.28rem}
  .status-pill {display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;padding:.35rem .65rem;font-size:.72rem;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
  .status-locked {border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 55%,var(--border));color:var(--warning-text)}
  .lifecycle-reason {margin:1rem 0;padding:.85rem 1rem;border-left:3px solid var(--warning);border-radius:0 var(--radius-sm) var(--radius-sm) 0;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 8%,var(--bg-card));color:var(--text);font-size:.86rem;line-height:1.5}
  .lifecycle-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}
  .lifecycle-step {display:flex;min-width:0;min-height:116px;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;gap:.6rem;padding:.85rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:var(--bg-card)}
  .step-number {color:var(--accent-text);font:700 .72rem var(--font-mono,monospace)}
  .lifecycle-step strong {font-size:.82rem}.lifecycle-step p {margin:.3rem 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.72rem;line-height:1.45}
  .step-state {align-self:flex-start;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700}
  .action-row {display:flex;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:1rem}
  .action-row button:disabled {opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
  .btn-danger {border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--error) 55%,var(--border));color:var(--error-text)}
  .lifecycle-footnote {margin:.8rem 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.5}
  .technical-diagnostics {margin-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:.75rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.5}
  .technical-diagnostics summary {cursor:pointer;color:var(--text);font-weight:700}
  .technical-diagnostics p {margin:.55rem 0 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .catalog-heading {align-items:flex-end}.catalog-search {display:flex;min-width:min(100%,280px);flex-direction:column;gap:.35rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700}
  .catalog-search input {min-width:260px;background:var(--bg-card);color:var(--text);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);padding:.62rem .75rem;font:inherit}
  .catalog-search input:focus-visible {outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
  .catalog-status {margin:1rem 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.82rem}
  .catalog-grid {display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,310px),1fr));gap:.8rem}
  .catalog-grid :global(.catalog-card) {display:flex;min-width:0;flex-direction:column;gap:.75rem;padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-md);background:var(--bg-card)}
  .catalog-grid :global(.catalog-card-head) {display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:.8rem}
  .catalog-grid :global(.catalog-card h3) {margin:0;font-size:1rem}
  .catalog-grid :global(.catalog-card-intro) {margin:.2rem 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.45}
  .catalog-grid :global(.source-badge) {flex:none;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;padding:.3rem .55rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700}
  .catalog-grid :global(.source-badge[data-state="loaded"]) {border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--success) 55%,var(--border));color:var(--success-text)}
  .catalog-grid :global(.source-badge[data-state="missing"]) {border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--warning) 55%,var(--border));color:var(--warning-text)}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-list) {display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:.5rem}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-row) {padding:.7rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--bg-panel) 76%,var(--bg-card))}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-row h4) {margin:0 0 .45rem;font-size:.83rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-facts) {display:flex;gap:.35rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .catalog-grid :global(.fact-chip) {display:inline-flex;max-width:100%;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:999px;padding:.23rem .45rem;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.66rem;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-manage-link) {display:inline-flex;margin-top:.55rem;color:var(--accent-text);font-size:.75rem;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-manage-link:hover) {text-decoration:underline}
  .catalog-grid :global(.component-manage-link:focus-visible) {outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
  .catalog-grid :global(.empty-source) {margin:0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.78rem;line-height:1.5}
  .empty-state {margin:1rem 0 0;color:var(--text-muted);font-size:.84rem}
  .skills-links {display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(220px,.85fr) minmax(0,1.5fr);align-items:center;gap:1.3rem}
  .management-links {display:flex;justify-content:flex-end;gap:.45rem;flex-wrap:wrap}
  .management-links a {display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem;padding:.58rem .72rem;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);background:var(--bg-card);color:var(--text);font-size:.76rem;text-decoration:none}
  .management-links a span {color:var(--accent-text)}.management-links a:hover {border-color:var(--accent-text);color:var(--accent-text)}
  .management-links a:focus-visible {outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:2px}
  @media(max-width:1050px) {.overview-grid {grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.lifecycle-grid {grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr))}.skills-links {grid-template-columns:1fr}.management-links {justify-content:flex-start}}
  @media(max-width:620px) {.install-page {gap:.8rem}.install-hero,.lifecycle-panel,.catalog-section,.skills-links {padding:1rem}.overview-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.55rem}.summary-card {padding:.8rem}.lifecycle-grid {grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.lifecycle-step {min-height:104px}.catalog-search {width:100%}.catalog-search input {box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;min-width:0}.action-row button {flex:1 1 100%}}
</style>
